{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/bc78620f7dcb53b081c0ed0ac840b274.poster.avif?t=1774222871\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/bc78620f7dcb53b081c0ed0ac840b274.mp4?t=1774222871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DeTails</i> is a punk-powered adventure about The HEXES as they travel around Long Den on their first ever tour. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something strange is happening at the location of each venue, colourless voids are disrupting normal life and someone has been kidnapping the local mole population.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/41a48ea9c89adf407206600f6eb6a5de.poster.avif?t=1774222871\" width=1170 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/41a48ea9c89adf407206600f6eb6a5de.webm?t=1774222871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/41a48ea9c89adf407206600f6eb6a5de.mp4?t=1774222871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a vibrant world of rebellion, freedom, friendship and growing up without losing your edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Long Den, a visually stunning 2D/3D world oozing with character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a whole host of local weirdos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use colour to change the environment and solve puzzles or just ruin someone's day!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the pigs and make your mark with the graffiti ability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master mini games like high-speed downhill racing and crowd rocking bass playing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DeTails</i> is set to an exciting and atmospheric punk and alternative soundtrack featuring real artists.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/19d64667e6dd1d38d736328a08aef637.poster.avif?t=1774222871\" width=1170 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/19d64667e6dd1d38d736328a08aef637.webm?t=1774222871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/19d64667e6dd1d38d736328a08aef637.mp4?t=1774222871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3840340?t=1774222871","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/aa8c27a2a7cec0b986a53e272092dc96184f6544/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774222871","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/dab711f7e194e376fcbdf4737bc1aa7be488333d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774222871","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/dab711f7e194e376fcbdf4737bc1aa7be488333d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774222871","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/bc78620f7dcb53b081c0ed0ac840b274.poster.avif?t=1774222871\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/bc78620f7dcb53b081c0ed0ac840b274.mp4?t=1774222871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DeTails</i> is a punk-powered adventure about The HEXES as they travel around Long Den on their first ever tour. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something strange is happening at the location of each venue, colourless voids are disrupting normal life and someone has been kidnapping the local mole population.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/41a48ea9c89adf407206600f6eb6a5de.poster.avif?t=1774222871\" width=1170 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/41a48ea9c89adf407206600f6eb6a5de.webm?t=1774222871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/41a48ea9c89adf407206600f6eb6a5de.mp4?t=1774222871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a vibrant world of rebellion, freedom, friendship and growing up without losing your edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Long Den, a visually stunning 2D/3D world oozing with character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a whole host of local weirdos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use colour to change the environment and solve puzzles or just ruin someone's day!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the pigs and make your mark with the graffiti ability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master mini games like high-speed downhill racing and crowd rocking bass playing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DeTails</i> is set to an exciting and atmospheric punk and alternative soundtrack featuring real artists.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/19d64667e6dd1d38d736328a08aef637.poster.avif?t=1774222871\" width=1170 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/19d64667e6dd1d38d736328a08aef637.webm?t=1774222871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/19d64667e6dd1d38d736328a08aef637.mp4?t=1774222871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Can You Eat It?"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/ea5c3b1b5544fdf6949d1d0d6fac431f6758ad14/header.jpg?t=1774222871","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3840340/1653091140/eb4ee49bcc53b2ea1ba7ccf52b247af5022ecc68/1774199